<title>CHINA: KEPCO seen in US$500 mln 364-day FRN.</title>
<headline>KEPCO seen in US$500 mln 364-day FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Electric Power Corp has launched a 364-day US$500 million floating rate notes issue, bankers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said the notes pay a coupon of 15 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate and were priced and re-offered at par. Fees are 10 basis points.</p>
<p>SBC Warburg is lead manager, they said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
